sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Extractor as model-extractor CLI
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(data/)
    participant Build as Konflux Build
    participant Container as Data Container<br/>(/app/data/)
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant MC as odh-model-controller

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over CI,FS: Flow 1: CI/CD Model Metadata Extraction Pipeline
        CI->>Extractor: Run model-extractor
        Extractor->>HF: GET /api/collections (Bearer HF_TOKEN optional)
        HF-->>Extractor: Model collections list
        Extractor->>HF: GET /api/models/{id}/README (Bearer HF_TOKEN optional)
        HF-->>Extractor: Model README content

        par Concurrent OCI extraction (max 5 goroutines)
            Extractor->>OCI: Fetch OCI manifest (Docker config auth)
            OCI-->>Extractor: Image manifest + layers
            Extractor->>Extractor: Extract modelcard from annotated layer
        end

        Extractor->>Extractor: Enrich metadata (HF README + vLLM config)
        Extractor->>FS: Write validated-models-catalog.yaml
        Extractor->>FS: Write other-models-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over CI,FS: Flow 2: CI/CD Agent Catalog Pipeline
        CI->>Extractor: Run model-extractor (--agent-index)
        Extractor->>GH: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo} (Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN optional)
        GH-->>Extractor: Agent metadata
        Extractor->>GH: GET raw README content
        GH-->>Extractor: Agent README
        Extractor->>FS: Write redhat-agents-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Build,Dashboard: Flow 3: Runtime Data Consumption
        Build->>Container: COPY data/*.yaml /app/data/
        Note over Container: sleep infinity (data-only)
        Dashboard->>Container: Volume mount read /app/data/
        Container-->>Dashboard: Catalog YAML files
        MC->>Container: Data reference
        Container-->>MC: Serving runtime catalog
    end
